ind":"update","title":"《Ocean Homeward:Soul Summoner Survivors》Demo 0.4 Update Announcement","summary":"Dear Captains, hello everyone!The Demo 0.4 update for Ocean Homeward: Soul Summoner Survivors is now live. Main contents include:Optimized the player ship model and detail presentation;Enriched the overall combat experience;Updated some UI interfaces;Improved frame rates in combat scenes;Fixed known bugs.Important NotesThis update is a staged version in our ongoing iteration. We are still working hard to create more spirits and richer gameplay. Stay tuned.Some visual and numerical adjustments ar","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T19:47:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498225823","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:51:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4563140-1842846814452740","game_id":"steam-4563140","kind":"update","title":"《Ocean Homeward:Soul Summoner Survivors》Demo 0.2 Update Announcement","summary":"Dear Captains, hello everyone!The Demo 0.2 update for Ocean Homeward: Soul Summoner Survivors is now live. The main contents include:Added more islands for greater battlefield variety;Fixed certain particle effect anomalies;Adjusted enemy sizes to improve collision feel;Overall improvement in combat smoothness and feedback;Fixed multiple known UI logic errors.Important NotesThis update is part of our ongoing iterative development. We are still working hard on the summoner class, more spirits, an","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-07T10:18:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814452740","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:51:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4563140-1842212951307499","game_id":"steam-4563140","kind":"update","title":"《Ocean Homeward: Soul Summoner Survivors》Demo 0.18 Update Announcement","summary":"Dear Captains, hello everyone!The Demo 0.18 update for Ocean Homeward: Soul Summoner Survivors has been officially released. Welcome aboard!This update focuses on visual upgrades to the sea area, tuning of spirit combat feel, and performance improvements. We hope every voyage across the Forgotten Sea will be more immersive and smoother.Demo 0.18 Update Contents at a GlanceComprehensive visual overhaul of the sea areaNew \"Rare Soul-Tear Altar\" addedSkill visuals for all spirits remadeSkill damage","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-30T12:26:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951307499","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:51:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4563140-1840944183785276","game_id":"steam-4563140","kind":"update","title":"《Ocean-Homeward: Soul Summoner Survivors》 – Demo 0.15 Patch Notes","summary":"Captains, Demo 0.15 is now live! This is part of our regular update cycle. We will continue to iterate steadily and enhance your sailing experience.🆕 New FeaturesAdded various small enemy typesImplemented ship ramming mechanic⚙️ Optimizations & AdjustmentsSignificantly optimized frame rate performanceReadjusted overall difficulty curveSignificantly increased default dash charges🖥️ UI & Interaction PolishRefined hero ascension UI🐞 Bug FixesFixed various known issues.📢 What's NextIn future updates","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-17T06:56:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183785276","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:51:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4563140-1839676055893507","game_id":"steam-4563140","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo 0.1 Is Now Available!